an><br><br>(based on personal judgment, opinion or intuition)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">My sister is going to have a baby.</span><br><br>(bsed on present evidence or the predicted event is very near and is sure to happen)\\\"}\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">arrangement</span> \\\"}\",\"\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I'm flying to Paris on the 23rd of this month.</span><br><br>(plans and arragements have been made)\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "tough nut to crack"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a difficult problem or opponent "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Peter's dad is a tough nut to crack. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le01ob07aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to talk about family."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to memorize"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to learn so you can remember"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Dad expect me to memorize the sports stats every day."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le01ob07aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to update"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to give someone more recent information"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Call me and update me on what happened! "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le01ob07aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to grill"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to question relentlessly"}, {"type": "part_speech", 