 "heading", "content": "Talkin on the Phone "}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You can keep a conversation in English by talking about different topics. You can ask questions, respond to or comment on what the person you are talking to is telling you.<br /><br /> Example:<br /> <span class=\"italic\">Really? He's a tough nut to crack?</span><br />  <span class=\"italic\">Really? He's a tough nut to crack?</span><br /> <span class=\"italic\">Yeah. He's very uncompromising.</span><br /> <span class=\"italic\">Every morning, he expects me to read the sports stats in the paper, memorize them and then update him over breakfast.</span><br /><br />  When it's time end your conversation, you can say goodbye, or just leave with a comment."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":1,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Ending a Conversation with Friends\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Bye. Talk to you later!\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Gotta go!\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Something is coming for you. I feel it. Bye.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Make a list of 10 questions - both comfortable and uncomfortable that they could ask."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Roleplay with a partner. You are at dinner. Have them ask you the questions. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Answer politely, but don't get angry or upset."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Trade roles and repeat."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I write a list of 10 questions to ask someone."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I roleplay with a partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I listen carefully to the questions."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I answer questions politely."}]}], "labs": [{"exercises": [{"template_overr